OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain spreading southeast this
OL,6,Fmorning across Argyll and the Central
OL,7,FBelt, the odd shower in the south.
OL,8,FArgyll becoming dry this afternoon but
OL,9,Frain, occasionally heavy, across the
OL,10,FCentral Belt and south.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy across the Central
OL,13,FBelt and south with rain at times.
OL,14,FArgyll will be mainly dry this evening
OL,15,Fand overnight with clear periods
OL,16,Facross the north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
