OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy with spells of rain,
OL,6,Falthough drier weather tending to
OL,7,Fspread south during the day. Further
OL,8,Frain spreading northeast in the
OL,9,Fevening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FMainly dry Thursday, further rain
OL,13,Fspreading northeast in the evening.
OL,14,FOvernight rain soon clearing on
OL,15,FFriday, then bright with a few showers
OL,16,Fin the west. Mainly dry Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
